<section class="border-b border-border bg-card"><div class="container-page py-14 sm:py-20"><div class="mb-8"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-muted-foreground"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a class="hover:text-accent" href="<?php echo esc_url( home_url( '/' ) ); ?>">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-current="page" class="text-foreground">Privacy Policy</span></li></ol></nav></div><p class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-6 bg-accent"></span>Legal</p><h1 class="max-w-4xl text-4xl leading-[1.08] sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">What we collect, why we collect it, how long we keep it, and the controls you have over all of it.</p></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="container-page"><div class="max-w-3xl"><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: 1 July 2026</p><section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl leading-snug">Who we are</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">PawlogicTech Ltd. is the data controller for personal data processed through this website and the PawlogicTech platform. Our registered office is Union House, 14 Bourne Terrace, London W2 5TH, United Kingdom. Data protection enquiries can be sent to hello@pawlogictech.com.</p></section><section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl leading-snug">Data we collect</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We collect only what the service requires to function.</p><ul class="mt-5 space-y-2.5"><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Account data: name, email address, telephone number and billing details.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Pet profile data: species, breed, age, weight, neuter status and relevant medical history you choose to provide.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Sensor data: physiological measurements, activity, environmental readings, intake and location where those services are enabled.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Behavioural event labels derived from on-device audio classification. Raw audio is never transmitted or stored.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Technical data: device identifiers, IP address and diagnostic logs required for security and support.</li></ul></section><section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl leading-snug">How audio is handled</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Acoustic classification runs entirely on the sensor hardware. The audio stream is analysed in memory and immediately discarded. Only a classified event label, such as 'distress vocalisation, four minutes', is transmitted to our servers. Human speech is never recorded, stored or transmitted.</p></section><section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl leading-snug">Lawful bases for processing</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We process account and sensor data to perform our contract with you. We process technical and security data on the basis of our legitimate interest in keeping the platform secure and functional. Marketing communications are sent only with your consent, which you can withdraw at any time.</p></section><section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl leading-snug">Data sharing</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We do not sell personal or pet data, and we do not share it with insurers, advertisers or data brokers under any circumstances. Data is shared only with sub-processors who provide infrastructure to us under contract, and with any veterinary professional or third party you explicitly choose to share a report with.</p></section><section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl leading-snug">Retention</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Monitoring data is retained for as long as your account is active because longitudinal history is the basis of the service. On account closure, data is deleted within 90 days unless you request an export first, or unless we are required to retain records for legal or accounting purposes.</p></section><section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl leading-snug">Security</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Data is encrypted in transit using TLS and at rest using industry-standard encryption. Access within our organisation is role-restricted and logged. We conduct regular security reviews and maintain an incident response process.</p></section><section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl leading-snug">Your rights</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Under UK GDPR and equivalent legislation you have the following rights.</p><ul class="mt-5 space-y-2.5"><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Access a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Request correction of inaccurate data.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Request erasure of your data, subject to legal retention requirements.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Request portability of your data in a machine-readable format.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Object to or restrict certain processing.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Withdraw consent for marketing communications at any time.</li></ul></section><section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl leading-snug">Complaints</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Please contact us first at hello@pawlogictech.com so we can resolve the matter. If you remain dissatisfied, you have the right to complain to the Information Commissioner's Office in the United Kingdom, or your local supervisory authority.</p></section></div></div></section><script>(function(a,f){let l;try{l=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem(a)||"{}")}catch{return}const n=l?.[f||history.state?.__TSR_key];let c=!1;for(const t in n){const e=n[t],o=e?.scrollX,s=e?.scrollY;if(Number.isFinite(o)&&Number.isFinite(s)){if(t==="window")scrollTo(o,s),c=!0;else if(t)try{const r=document.querySelector(t);r&&(r.scrollLeft=o,r.scrollTop=s)}catch{}}}if(c)return;const i=location.hash.slice(1);if(i){const t=history.state?.__hashScrollIntoViewOptions??!0;if(t){const e=document.getElementById(i);e&&e.scrollIntoView(t)}return}scrollTo(0,0)})("tsr-scroll-restoration-v1_3");document.currentScript.remove()</script>
